// MEP1 Lletya Arianwyn first Talk-to after licensed Eluned.
// CANDIDATE last-resort pre-SoE dump (period-media §6) minus Essyllt /
// 8-charge / dest / crystal give. Hunt 289? no.
// Gate mourning_quest >= 1. Stay 1. No dest. Cite mep1-arianwyn-talk-only-377.md.

[opnpc1,mourning_arianwyn]
if (%mourning_quest < 1) {
    ~displaymessage(^dm_default);
    return;
}
~chatnpc("<p,happy>Good day <displayname()>, I have been hoping to see you. It has come to my attention that there are large numbers of those you know as 'Mourners' crossing the mountain pass through Arandar.");
~chatplayer("<p,quiz>Mourners? Here in Tirannwn? But why?");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>Why? It is quite simple really and it is hardly a big secret. Those you know as Mourners are in fact Elves from the city.");
~chatnpc("<p,quiz>The big question is: Why are they heading to Ardougne in such numbers?");
~chatplayer("<p,shock>Mourners are Elves? But I thought they were the West Ardougne guard.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>This is what King Lathas would have you believe.");
~chatnpc("<p,sad>We have been unable to infiltrate West Ardougne. The Mourner guard could identify us as enemy Elves before we could even get close to the walls. They must be up to something new, something we have not anticipated.");
~chatplayer("<p,quiz>Alright, cut to the crux. What do you need me to do?");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>That which we are unable to do, penetrate the Mourners' hide-out in Ardougne without alerting them to your presence, find out why they are there and what they are up to.");
~chatplayer("<p,quiz>So let me get this right. You want me to infiltrate the Mourners and find out their plans?");
~chatnpc("<p,happy>Yes.");
~chatplayer("<p,quiz>And just how am I supposed to achieve that?");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>I have no idea, but I know we can count on you. If I had a plan I would share it with you, but I am lost for ideas. You have proved you are capable of such things in the past.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>As I said before, there have been sightings of Mourners crossing the mountain pass.");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>Alright, I'll see what I can do.");
return;
